SHIPPED — what is on disk today

File: openOODA/SHIPPED.oot
One page. What you can run right now.
DESIGN is the want list. SPRINT is this week. PM is the pin.
Read the code if a row here is old.

REAL

Product path: the seed (trusted first oodac binary), then gcc.

  Compiler loop
    oodac check, emit-c, run / ooda CLI

  Self-host floor
    Backend-C: emit C, link the C runtime (chs_rt), then gcc, via the seed

  File seals
    read_file, write_file, path_exists, file_size, fs_mkdir, fs_remove_file
    Tokens: FsReadCap, FsWriteCap (old FsCap still accepted)

  Net seals
    fetch uses HttpCap
    TCP / UDP / bind slot IO uses TcpCap, UdpCap, BindCap
    ooda-pm (package manager) uses NetCap and FsWriteCap (sandbox)

  Process exec
    sys_exec and process_exec use ProcessCap (or SysCap)

  Process args and walk
    process_args(ProcessCap) in ../ooda/std/os/process.oo
    fs_walk(FsReadCap) in ../ooda/std/os/fs.oo

  Env, time, rand, alloc
    EnvCap (OODA_ and OO_ keys)
    TimeCap, RandCap, AllocCap

  Threads
    mutex, spawn, join, channels — ThreadCap

  Super SWARM Waves A-F (Shipped 2026-08-14)
    Wave A: Type-State Proofs & Refinement Solver (std/src/ooda/typestate/, std/src/ooda/proofs/)
    Wave B: Native LLVM IR Backend Emitter (oodac/llvm_emit_*.oo)
    Wave C: GPU / NPU Accelerated SIMD Compute Pipeline (std/src/ooda/gpu/, std/src/ooda/npu/)
    Wave D: Contract Fuzzing & Ghost-State Pre/Post Verification (std/src/ooda/fuzz/, std/src/ooda/proofs/)
    Wave E: Native Language Server Protocol (LSP) Engine (std/src/ooda/lsp/, ooda/lsp/)
    Wave F: Package Manager Dependency Resolver & Capability Mint Authority (ooda/pm/, std/src/ooda/sec/mint/)

  GPU gate
    gpu_launch + GpuCap (CPU / noop path today)

  Type-state
    // TYPESTATE: Type S1 S2
    // TYPESTATE fn name: From -> To
    Check refuses a wrong lifecycle.
    if/else and match arms join. Alias and s.connect() share the name.
    States belong to a type. main honors TYPESTATE end. Imports keep directives.

  Contracts
    requires / ensures, simple runtime, && works

  Secrets
    SECRET: checked at compile time. Separate from Caps.

  CPU bound
    MAX_CYCLES: N on while, for, and recursion

  Agent tools
    outline, reflect, --json-errors, patch, ooda fix (bounded classes)

  Memory
    ARC frees when the last ref drops (default PURE_NO_ARC=0)

  Path-A decoys
    Path-a is the small decoy path: fake pads so memory offsets change.
    METAMORPHIC: path-a emits __oo_meta_decoy_*
    meta_epoch() exists

  AST Macros & Metaprogramming
    ../ooda/oodac/ast_macros.oo, ../std/src/ooda/macro/ (ast_types, ast_quote, ast_expand, ast_transform)
    Compile-time AST macro expansion and syntax quotation.

  WebAssembly Backend Emitter
    ../ooda/oodac/wasm_emit_*.oo
    Full arithmetic/bitwise/logical Pratt parsing, while/for loops, conditionals, memory allocator, WASI preview1.

  Object-Capabilities & Landlock Sandboxing
    ../std/src/ooda/sec/sys/landlock_*.oo, objcap_*.oo
    Cryptographic capability sealing, monotonic rights diminution, and Landlock OS filesystem/network sandbox translation.

  Data-Oriented Design & Struct-of-Arrays
    ../std/src/ooda/dod/soa_layout_*.oo, dod_layout_*.oo
    Columnar SoA buffers, 64-byte cache alignment, SIMD streaming transforms, and kinematic integrations.

  Std product
    ../ooda/std and ../std modules (740 files across crypto, sys, sec, dod, macro, 3d, robot, quantum, fin, enterprise)
    100% DINNER.oot Academy-style headers and <= 256-line modular decomposition.

  Scripts
    ../ooda/scripts/*_smoke.oo — 100% Academy-style headers and <= 256 lines.
    Plan: ../ooda/COOKBOOK.oot. Rules: SCRIPTING.oot.
    Automated pre-commit hooks and dinner_lint.oo active.

Ops: ../ooda/bootstrap/CAPS_MATRIX.oot
Token names: CAPS.oot


SIDE SLICE

These files exist. They are their own units.

  Load-time hide
    ../ooda/runtime/oo_hide.c
    OODA_HIDE=1 fills a 16-slot table at process start

  Merkle helper
    ../ooda/runtime/oo_holo.c and oo_sha256.c
    Persist and load a blob with a hash root

  Editor helper
    ../vscode/ — ooda-lsp, started through vscode-languageclient
    Hover uses the open file and fn at the cursor
    Diagnostics come from oodac check

  Grammar probe
    ../tree-sitter/grammar.js — parse probe in that tree


